  "body": "# NapCat v4.18.41\n\n[使用文档](https://napneko.github.io/) · [Shell 安装与兼容说明](https://napneko.github.io/guide/boot/Shell)\n\n## 更新\n\n- fix(album): restore comments and support batch targets ([3f66b369](https://github.com/NapNeko/NapCatQQ/commit/3f66b369017cf1e202583257baa0c19406cd186c))\n- fix(onebot): preserve profile regions in user and member responses (#2107) ([810052c6](https://github.com/NapNeko/NapCatQQ/commit/810052c605feb5044a080adfe99ba2fa69b7b351))\n- Remove ghproxy.imciel.com from proxy URLs (#2108) ([450fb042](https://github.com/NapNeko/NapCatQQ/commit/450fb0429a064e3418e0c698b1b4d78324101929))\n- fix: #2100 ([89e8efc5](https://github.com/NapNeko/NapCatQQ/commit/89e8efc57ee38777dd20b818d5b2c3321414f7aa))\n- fix(ci): avoid resolving dev dependencies in release artifacts ([859eb530](https://github.com/NapNeko/NapCatQQ/commit/859eb530c5801577633c2c3ae871d23586edf281))\n\n[完整变更](https://github.com/NapNeko/NapCatQQ/compare/v4.18.38...v4.18.41)\n",
